  "summary": "Malicious code in base65-77x (npm)",
  "details": "Base65-77x is a trojanized clone of the base-x encoding library. Its decode() function in src/cjs/index.cjs and src/esm/index.js has been modified to POST the string being decoded to hxxp://46[.]250[.]253[.]63:3000/api/log via fetch before returning the result. Any application that uses this library to decode base64/base58 strings silently sends the decoded content to that remote server, exfiltrating whatever data the host application decodes.",
